my invite gives you 2 weeks of it free (if your account is new to Grok):\nhttps://t.co/Mznq32dnzi", "url": "https://x.com/johnherzog/status/2115990181610438686"}, {"article": {"title": "5\u4e2aAI\u79c1\u4eba\u52a9\u7406\uff0c\u4f60\u8be5\u7528\u54ea\u4e2a\uff1fMuse\u3001dots\u3001Cue\u3001Grok Bot\u3001Today \u4e00\u6b21\u8bb2\u6e05"}, "author_id": "1516695275389169665", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:48:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115984059298103572"], "id": "2115984059298103572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1822, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "5\u4e2aAI\u79c1\u4eba\u52a9\u7406\u600e\u4e48\u9009\uff1f\u6211\u628a Muse\u3001dots\u3001Cue\u3001Grok Bot\u3001Today \u7684\u4ef7\u683c\u9875\u548c\u516c\u5f00\u8bc4\u6d4b\u8fc7\u4e86\u4e00\u904d\uff0810/30\u590d\u6838\uff09\uff1a\u529f\u80fd\u5df2\u8d8b\u540c\uff0c\u5dee\u522b\u5728\u5165\u53e3\u3001\u80fd\u5426\u8fdb\u5c01\u95ed\u5e73\u53f0\u3001\u4fe1\u4efb\u3002\u9644\u5bf9\u7167\u8868\u548c48\u6761\u6765\u6e90\u3002\u5229\u76ca\u76f8\u5173\uff1a\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\u5728\u7528 Grok Bot\u3002 https://t.co/rtYWHwTAfG", "url": "https://x.com/vicyan1225/status/2115984059298103572"}, {"author_id": "1037725470630891520", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:45:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115983278578770249"], "id": "2115983278578770249", "in_reply_to_user_id": "949435306905923585", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115896458423759287", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@arc_tutorials Solid list. Builders are great for fixed workflows, but for everyday one-off tasks an always-on agent is easier. Grok Bot is a good one to try, and my invite includes 2 weeks free (if your account is new to Grok):\nhttps://t.co/Mznq32dnzi", "url": "https://x.com/johnherzog/status/2115983278578770249"}, {"author_id": "1037